  {
    "id": 2004011020060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "──っていう感じで",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "相手の男の人には許嫁のおって、\r\n主人公は身を引こうとするとよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そいで、もう遠くに行こうって\r\n鉄道に乗ろうとしたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "男の人が追いかけて来ると……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "男の人が呼び止めると、\r\n主人公が振り返って……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そこで、ご～んって\r\n時計台の鐘が鳴るとよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "汽車も、時計台の鐘も\r\nロマンチックで…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、\r\nそのシーンがうちのお気に入りばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\nなるほどなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そいでね、次のエッセイは\r\nその映画の話を書きたかとけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "映画を観とらん人にも、\r\nちゃんと伝わるとかな～？　って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あらすじとかも書いたら、\r\n文字数が足らん～ってなるし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かにそうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "この前のちゃんぽんは\r\nみんなに馴染みのあるものやったけん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、馴染みか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……恋鐘の言うとおり、\r\n内容を細かく伝えながらっていうのは難しいかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……けど\r\n恋鐘はその映画を面白いと思ったんだもんな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～！\r\nそうばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、ただその気持ちを\r\nまっすぐ記事にするだけでいいと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうすればきっと、\r\n映画を知らない人にも楽しんでもらえるはずだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……\r\nそうやろか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だって俺は今\r\n恋鐘の話を聞いてて楽しかったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、俺が保証するよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～\r\nそっか～……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん、そうやね",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、プロデューサーのおかげで\r\nよか記事の書けそうな気がする！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004011020240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、\r\n次のエッセイも期待しとってね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401102/2004011020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！\r\n楽しみにしてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
